WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:07.600
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain an American action crime thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Safe.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:22.640
In Nanjing, China lives a little girl named&nbsp;
Mei. She is a gifted mathematician who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:27.600
solve complicated mathematical problems in her&nbsp;
head. She also has a great memory and never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.440
forgets any series of numbers she comes across.&nbsp;
One day, Mei is walking home with her friends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.520
when a group of men abducts her. She is taken&nbsp;
to a Chinese mafia leader named Han. The digital&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:45.680
data of Han’s criminal enterprise is traceable,&nbsp;
hence he wants to use Mei as his personal mental&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.280
calculator who can memorize the data for him.&nbsp;
Initially, the little girl refuses to cooperate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:56.400
but when he threatens to kill her mother, she&nbsp;
agrees to do as told. Under the care of their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:02.000
trusted gang member, Chang, Mei is brought to&nbsp;
New York where she is hidden as his daughter.
&nbsp;

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.240
Somewhere Else in New Jersey, former cop and&nbsp;
cage fighter Luke is in an intense match with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:14.240
opponent. He has set the match up and is supposed&nbsp;
to lose. But he accidentally throws a punch at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:19.920
his opponent and knocks him out into a coma.&nbsp;
The win angers the head of the Russian mafia,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:25.280
Emile who lost millions of dollars on Luke.&nbsp;
Luke realizes that an angry gangster would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:30.240
mean that his family is in trouble. He&nbsp;
rushes home but is too late because the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:38.640
gangster's son Vassily has already killed his&nbsp;
pregnant wife. Luke is devastated by the death&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:44.080
and although he can fight, he doesn’t retaliate.&nbsp;
The thugs then promise to kill anyone with whom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:51.040
he speaks to or makes contact. With nowhere and&nbsp;
no one to go to, Luck returns to his hometown,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:56.560
New York. He starts living as a homeless person,&nbsp;
wandering around in the streets of Manhattan. 
&nbsp;

00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:01.120
One year later, Mei is still working with the&nbsp;
gang. Chang takes her on a weekly round of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:07.280
streets in Chinatown. She memorizes the percentage&nbsp;
of net profit or loss every store faces. The store&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:11.280
owners are supposed to pay the gang a certain&nbsp;
amount of money according to the profit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:15.600
hence Mei is proven to be a useful asset&nbsp;
to them. Throughout her time working with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:20.080
the gang, she has learned a lot about how&nbsp;
business works in the gangster world. 
&nbsp;

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:25.680
Somewhere else, Luke lives in a highly unorganized&nbsp;
homeless shelter. One night, he meets a man with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:31.440
no shoes and severely infected feet. Out of&nbsp;
sympathy, he gives the man his new shoes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:36.320
But the next day, he wakes up to discover&nbsp;
that someone slit the poor guy’s throat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:41.760
and stole his shoe overnight. Suffice to say&nbsp;
that Luke’s living conditions are poor.
&nbsp;

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:46.400
Meanwhile, a lady working closely with Chang&nbsp;
approaches Mei in the middle of the night&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:51.600
and informs her of her mother’s death back in&nbsp;
China. It turns out that she was severely sick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:57.280
and in hospital. The following day, the leader of&nbsp;
the gang Han comes to New York for the first time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:02.880
since he sent Mei. He has come with a piece of&nbsp;
paper with a series of numbers on it. Mei is asked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:08.000
to memorize the number which she does in less&nbsp;
than ten seconds. The numbers seem to be of great&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.600
importance because Han burns the piece of paper&nbsp;
to ashes so only Mei would know what they are. 
&nbsp;

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:18.240
After that, Chang takes her to the next location.&nbsp;
Mei is told that she will have to memorize the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:23.040
second series of numbers when she reaches the&nbsp;
destination. Everything goes according to the plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:29.440
until they are attacked by the Russian mafia;&nbsp;
led by Emil, the gangster who killed Luke’s wife.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:35.200
They are also after Mei because of the numbers she&nbsp;
has memorized. A shootout ensues where the Chinese&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:41.200
gangsters lose to the Russians who abduct Mei.&nbsp;
Somewhere else, Luke is having a bad day because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:46.160
a passerby stole his breakfast money. While&nbsp;
trying to buy something, he bumps into his former&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:51.040
colleague in the police force. The man instantly&nbsp;
recognizes Luke and takes him to an abandoned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:56.800
building with his fellow cops. Long back, Luke&nbsp;
debunked their corrupt ways of helping the local&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:02.560
gangsters. The cops are still furious at him for&nbsp;
getting them in trouble back then. They beat him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:09.280
up and insult him but he doesn’t retaliate. In&nbsp;
the end, a cop hands Luke a gun, urging him to end&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:16.240
his own life. But Luke refuses and walks away.
At the same time, Mei is taken to the Russian gang&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:21.280
leader Emile who asks her about the numbers. She&nbsp;
soon finds out that the lady who told her about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:26.480
her mother was helping Emil the entire time.&nbsp;
The lady also asks Mei to tell them the code,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:32.320
but in turn, Mei claims that the woman is going to&nbsp;
die because she doesn’t know how business works.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:38.400
Right after, the men shoot her dead since she is&nbsp;
no use to them anymore. Mei knows she will suffer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:44.800
the same fate if she tells them the number, hence,&nbsp;
she keeps quiet. Just then, a corrupt cop and one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:50.000
of Luke’s former colleagues, Captain Wolf, come&nbsp;
to the Russian hideout to catch the criminals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:56.400
However, he is not doing it for law, but on the&nbsp;
orders of the Chinese leader, Han. Emile calls the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:01.760
Captain and offers him double the money than the&nbsp;
Chinese gangsters to get away from his hideout.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:07.840
The corrupt captain accepts the deal and retreats.&nbsp;
By this time, Mei has run away from the hideout&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:13.200
without anyone seeing her. Both the Russians and&nbsp;
Chinese gangsters start looking for her, in hopes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:18.240
of finding her before the other group does.
Mei eventually reaches the subway station where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:24.640
Luke is about to end his life. He is seconds away&nbsp;
from jumping on the tracks when he locks eyes with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:30.240
the scared little girl and stops himself. He also&nbsp;
notices the gangsters who killed his wife looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:34.880
for the little girl. To run away from them, she&nbsp;
gets on the subway but the gang gets a glimpse of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:40.640
her and follows behind. Luke realizes something is&nbsp;
wrong and makes it his mission to save the girl.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:46.160
He latches onto the subway and kills all the&nbsp;
Russians on his way. One of them recognizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:51.120
Luke as the guy they beat up a year ago. He is&nbsp;
surprised as to how someone so submissive can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:57.840
defeat all their people in minutes. In the end,&nbsp;
he is also killed and Luke finally meets Mei. 
&nbsp;

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:02.640
But as soon as the subway stops, she runs away&nbsp;
with the crowd, mistaking Luke for one of the bad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:08.640
guys. On his way to look for her, Luke overhears&nbsp;
a red alert code being relayed to all the cops.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:14.320
He registers that the girl is also wanted by the&nbsp;
corrupt policemen who will definitely hand her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:20.080
the mafia. A few minutes in, two cops who beat&nbsp;
up Luke earlier find the girl and try to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:25.280
her away. Luke arrives at the right time and&nbsp;
knocks them out in an instant, proving that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:30.880
was staying quiet only because he wanted to. Mei&nbsp;
still doesn’t trust him but gets into a car with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:36.800
him when the Russian mafia arrives. A high-speed&nbsp;
car chase ensues in the streets of Manhattan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:42.960
At last, Luke kills all the Russians, steals&nbsp;
their wallets, and takes Mei to a fancy hotel. 
&nbsp;

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:48.160
Somewhere else, the captain finds out that&nbsp;
Mei was taken by force, not by the mafia but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:53.600
by Luke. He is in shock because Luke hasn’t been&nbsp;
involved in anything crime-related since he left&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:59.280
the police force. Meanwhile, after checking into&nbsp;
the hotel, Mei starts to trust Luke and tells him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:04.400
about the numbers she memorized. On checking the&nbsp;
format of the numbers, he figures out that it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:09.520
the combination of a safe. Mei says she was&nbsp;
supposed to memorize a second number before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:14.080
the Russians attacked, which means there are two&nbsp;
safes with something valuable in it, probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:19.840
being traded by the Chinese mafia. Just then,&nbsp;
Chang finds out Mei’s location using a tracking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:25.840
device in her phone. He and his henchmen arrive&nbsp;
at the hotel and start a shootout. Chaos ensues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:30.640
when people start to run for their lives. 
Eventually, Luke gets into a fistfight with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:35.520
the gangsters which causes him and Mei&nbsp;
to separate. Chang gets his hands on her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:40.000
while Luke escapes before he is killed. 
He knows that he cannot leave Mei alone and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:45.760
is ready to do anything to get her back safe. So,&nbsp;
he calls the Russian leader Emile’s son Vassily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:51.040
from a phone he stole earlier. Vassily is also&nbsp;
the guy who killed Luke’s wife a year ago. Luke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:55.680
pretends to be their gang member and claims that&nbsp;
he has the number that everyone is looking for.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:01.440
Vassily believes him and calls him to a casino&nbsp;
to deliver the said number. Somewhere else,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:06.720
the city’s mayor calls the corrupt police captain&nbsp;
to his office to discuss all the shootings. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:12.400
turns out that he and his boyfriend Alex are also&nbsp;
just as corrupt as the others. The mayor reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:18.800
that Luke wasn’t a normal cop. In fact, he was&nbsp;
a CIA agent, loaned to the police force after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:24.800
9/11. When he was in the police force, he and his&nbsp;
former partner Alex assassinated several crime&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:30.640
bosses in an effort to impose order. However,&nbsp;
Luke had to quit after exposing the corrupt ways&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:36.080
of the Captain and his squad. Alex stayed and&nbsp;
seduced the mayor to get to where he is now.
&nbsp;

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:40.720
The captain finally realizes that the guy&nbsp;
he thought was a loser, is actually the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:46.800
dangerous enemy he has ever had. Currently, Luke’s&nbsp;
former partner Alex is the mayor’s boyfriend who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:51.760
has gone corrupt like him. When the mayor is&nbsp;
informed about Mei and Luke being together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:57.040
he gets nervous. It is almost as if he knows&nbsp;
something about the safe and the combination&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:01.520
on it. In the meantime, Mei is brought back&nbsp;
to the leader Han who inquires if she told&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:07.280
the combination to anyone. She lies and insists&nbsp;
that she pretended not to understand English.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:11.280
Chang calls Alex and tells him that they have&nbsp;
the girl so they can continue the meeting.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:16.240
It is then revealed that the people the Chinese&nbsp;
mafia was trying to do business with are the mayor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:21.440
and his boyfriend Alex. They are trading the&nbsp;
unknown contents of their respective safes. 
&nbsp;

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:30.880
Next, Luke arrives at the Casino where he&nbsp;
finds the Russian gangsters. He ambushes all of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:36.320
Vassily’s henchmen and takes him hostage, planning&nbsp;
to use him to threaten the Russian leader Emile.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:41.280
He calls Emile and asks him about the contents&nbsp;
of the safe in exchange for his son’s life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:46.320
Emile discloses that the safe with the Chinese&nbsp;
gangsters has thirty million dollars in it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:50.960
while the safe with the mayor has something that&nbsp;
is worth the aforementioned money. The parties&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:56.320
were about to trade using the little girl but&nbsp;
the Russians stepped in and destroyed the plan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.800
However, now that the Chinese have Mei,&nbsp;
the plan is back on track. Chang goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:06.320
to meet Alex and exchange the codes. 
Now, the only way for Luke to save the girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:11.840
is by getting the thirty million dollars from the&nbsp;
Chinese mafia before the trade takes place. But,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:17.040
he cannot do it on his own because the safe is&nbsp;
hidden deep in Chinatown and protected by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:22.960
most dangerous ones of the Chinese gangsters. So,&nbsp;
he asks for help from his former cop colleagues.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:28.480
They agree to help, but only because of the money.&nbsp;
The group then walks into the hideout and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:38.640
a shootout. On the way, several gangsters and&nbsp;
cops die. When they finally reach the locker,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:44.480
Luke betrays the cops and shoots them dead,&nbsp;
except the captain, who he holds hostage alongside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:49.280
Vassily. He also takes the money from the safe&nbsp;
and makes his way to the mayor’s office. 
&nbsp;

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:54.480
On his way, he calls Alex and asks him what is&nbsp;
in the second safe. Because Luke has the money,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:59.920
Alex is bound to do everything he asks. He reveals&nbsp;
the second safe belongs to the mayor, containing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:06.080
a disc with data on every crime syndicate in New&nbsp;
York. The mayor wanted to sell it to the Chinese,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:11.040
take the thirty million and let the gangs deal&nbsp;
with what they had to. Alex was about to hold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:15.840
the deal with Chang but since the money has&nbsp;
already been stolen, he tries to return to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:22.160
Luke instead. But, Luke orders him to bring Mei&nbsp;
along because she is an important asset. Alex&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:27.600
follows the orders, kills Chang and his henchmen,&nbsp;
and drives to meet Luke along with the girl.
&nbsp;

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:31.760
In the following scene, Luke breaks into&nbsp;
the Mayor’s office and asks him for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:36.320
contents of the second safe. Although&nbsp;
the mayor is reluctant, he has no choice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:39.680
but to hand Luke a disc with the data on every&nbsp;
crime syndicate in New York. Luke knocks him out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:44.320
and returns to meet Alex like promised.
With both the money and the information,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:49.120
he is the most powerful one in the game&nbsp;
but Alex has something more special;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:54.880
Mei. When the two finally meet to exchange Mei&nbsp;
for the money, Luke refuses to cooperate, instead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.880 --> 00:12:00.480
suggesting that they settle it with a fight.&nbsp;
Alex gets ready but is shot in the leg by Mei.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:06.480
Taking the opportunity, Luke kills him with ease.&nbsp;
He and Mei are finally free with the money and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:12.000
disc that they can use for protection. For Mei’s&nbsp;
safety, Luke lets the captain free with fifty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:17.760
thousand dollars as compensation for his troubles.&nbsp;
He also lets Vassily go, so the Russians wouldn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:23.840
come after them. Then, there is the Chinese mafia&nbsp;
leader Han who got his money and Mei stolen from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:29.360
him. Luke sends him all of the remaining money&nbsp;
so he wouldn’t try to look for Mei anymore. 
&nbsp;

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:34.000
At last, he hides several copies of the disc&nbsp;
throughout the city. In case someone tries to harm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:40.160
them, they can use the drive as a way to blackmail&nbsp;
some powerful people. In the last scene, Mei and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:44.960
Luke drive to Seattle to start a new life. 
